        "message": "=```html <div style=\"background:#f4f5f7;padding:32px 16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">   <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;\">     <tr>       <td style=\"background:#004b57;padding:24px 32px;color:#ffffff;\">         <div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.85;\">           Borderline candidate         </div>          <div style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:6px;\">           {{ $('Validate Evaluation').first().json.name }} — {{ $('Validate Evaluation').first().json.score }}/100         </div>       </td>     </tr>      <tr>       <td style=\"padding:26px 32px;color:#1f2937;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">          <p>           Please review them, reply to the candidate directly and set their status in the Applications sheet to <b>Invite</b>; otherwise set it to <b>Declined</b>.         </p>          <p>           <b>Suggested interview questions</b>         </p>          <ol>           {{             $('Validate Evaluation').first().json.interview_questions               .map(x => '<li>' + x + '</li>')               .join('')           }}         </ol>        </td>     </tr>      <tr>       <td style=\"padding:14px 32px;background:#f9fafb;color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;text-align:center;\">         Horizon Byte Solutions &middot; Talent Acquisition       </td>     </tr>   </table> </div> ```",
