        "subject": "=Next step : interview for  {{ $('Validate Evaluation').item.json.position }}",
        "message": "=<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:0;padding:36px 16px;background:#f1f5f9;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:600px;margin:auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:32px;background:#16324f;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#93c5fd;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;\">\n          TALENT ACQUISITION\n        </p>\n        <h1 style=\"margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-size:28px;line-height:1.3;\">\n          Let’s meet, {{ $('Validate Evaluation').item.json.name.split(' ')[0] }}!\n        </h1>\n        <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;color:#dbeafe;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">\n          You’re invited to the next stage of your application.\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:32px;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;color:#334155;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;\">\n          Thank you for applying. We enjoyed reviewing your experience\n          and would love to learn more about you in an interview.\n        </p>\n\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background:#eff6ff;border-radius:12px;\">\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:22px;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1px;\">\n                YOUR OPPORTUNITY\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;color:#16324f;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.5;\">\n                {{ $('Validate Evaluation').item.json.position }}\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0;color:#475569;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;\">\n                <strong>Duration:</strong> 30 minutes<br>\n                <strong>Format:</strong> Online interview\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n\n        <h2 style=\"margin:28px 0 10px;color:#16324f;font-size:20px;\">\n          Choose a time that works for you\n        </h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;color:#475569;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">\n          Reply to this email with <strong>three available time slots</strong>\n          during the next five working days. Please include your\n          <strong>time zone</strong>.\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;color:#475569;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">\n          We’ll confirm your interview time and send you the meeting link.\n        </p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;color:#334155;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">\n          Looking forward to meeting you!<br>\n          <strong style=\"color:#16324f;\">Talent Acquisition Team</strong>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:20px 32px;background:#f8fafc;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;text-align:center;\">\n          Interview invitation · {{ $('Validate Evaluation').item.json.position }}\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</div>",
